msgstr "Amptelike name"

#: templates/official_names_review.html:155
msgid ""
"The AI suggests each game's full official name, as released in the region"
" of its ROM: a Japanese ROM of Mega Man becomes Rockman. Tick the names "
"you want and accept them. The old name is kept as an alternate title, and"
" an accepted name is kept when scraping. Nothing changes until you accept"
" it."
msgstr ""
"Die KI stel elke speletjie se volle amptelike naam voor, soos vrygestel "
"in die streek van sy ROM: 'n Japannese ROM van Mega Man word Rockman. "
"Merk die name wat jy wil hê en aanvaar hulle. Die ou naam word as 'n "
"alternatiewe titel behou, en 'n aanvaarde naam word behou wanneer "
"geskraap word. Niks verander voordat jy dit aanvaar nie."

